    Bug 2014903 - Part two - Refactor LocalCopyHeader() to have no copy/move knowledge. r=mkmelin


    There are separate preferences which govern which properties are excluded
    when moving or copying nsIMsgDBHdr objects. But callers don't alway have this
    info, so this patch pushes the responsibility further up the call chain,i
    where more context is available.
    Ultimately these prefs should be removed completely, but for now we're stuck
    with them.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D287506

